OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Our Island Music
OL,6,     FEel Pie island lies just 20 metres
OL,7,     Fover the Thames at Twickenham. It
OL,8,     Fhas a long history of jazz and
OL,9,     Frock and became a landmark of
OL,10,     FBritish music.
OL,11,G2200 Late Junction
OL,12,     FJennifer Lucy Allan shares the
OL,13,     Flatest in our series of improvised
OL,14,     Fcollaboration sessions, between
OL,15,     FSouth Indian percussionist Prathap
OL,16,     FRamachandra and modular synthesist
OL,17,     FLoula Yorke.
OL,18,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,19,     FSoweto welcomes leading Scottish
OL,20,     Fsaxophonist Harben Kay as his
OL,21,     FFriday night guest.
